OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court charged with storing
OL,4,Aexplosives, detonators and stun guns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 35-year-old man has been remanded in
OL,7,Fcustody charged with storing explosives
OL,8,Fand detonators in west Belfast.
OL,10,FWesley Thomas Fletcher is also accused
OL,11,Fof having a consignment of Taser stun
OL,12,Fguns.
OL,14,FPolice seized the devices during
OL,15,Fsearches at properties on the Shankill
OL,16,FRoad and Edwina Street over the
OL,17,Fweekend.
OL,19,FA number of residents had to be
OL,20,Fevacuated from their homes as a
OL,21,Fprecaution while the security operation
OL,22,Fwas carried out.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
